<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Rep sets 4-wk T-bill auction at max 12.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech Rep sets 4-wk T-bill auction at max 12.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Wednesday set an auction of four-week Treasury bills for Thursday, with the yield limited to a maximum 12.40 percent.</p>
<p>Bills totalling eight billion crowns will be offered in the American-style auction, with bids due to the CNB by 1200 CET (1000 gmt) on Thursday, the CNB said.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
